<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Comm - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Comm - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		303.72		vs	  223.61</p>
<p> Operating	   21.52		vs	    7.98</p>
<p> Current	     22.48		vs	    6.68</p>
<p> Net		    8.61		vs	    3.27</p>
<p> EPS		   45.76 yen	  vs	   17.39 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    188 million	  vs	 188 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.75 yen	  vs	    5.75 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 0.75 yen	  vs	    0.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Communication Industrial Co Ltd is a manufacturer of communications equipment.</p>
